cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "HCC Surveillance Markov Model"
abstract: >
  R code implementing a Markov model for hepatocellular carcinoma (HCC)
  surveillance in cirrhotic patients. Models BCLC-stage progression,
  ultrasound sensitivity, patient adherence, and treatment outcomes to
  estimate life-years gained under various surveillance strategies.
